WEBVTT

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:23.050
Before I knew it, I abandoned happiness to survive

00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:30.190
Lying to myself, I danced clinging on to illusions

00:00:30.990 --> 00:00:36.870
At the edge of my vision when I close my eyes

00:00:37.260 --> 00:00:42.830
I was searching for your smile

00:00:43.730 --> 00:00:50.200
With our memories fading

00:00:50.740 --> 00:00:57.280
We hold on to our dreams and run  Yeah

00:00:57.610 --> 00:01:04.180
These feelings that I shut away in my heart

00:01:04.720 --> 00:01:11.410
I'll now grasp them again

00:01:32.110 --> 00:01:35.140
The final match against Marik has begun.

00:01:35.140 --> 00:01:39.970
Marik, I'll defeat you to save Mai and Bakura!

00:01:39.970 --> 00:01:42.650
But in his Shadow Game...

00:01:42.650 --> 00:01:46.550
...my partner and Marik's other personality will be sacrificed.

00:01:46.550 --> 00:01:50.910
Ra has transformed into a phoenix and stopped Slifer's attack.

00:01:50.910 --> 00:01:56.460
Is there any way to defeat Marik and save the sacrifices?

00:01:56.460 --> 00:02:02.470
Fiend's Sanctuary Activates!

00:02:03.700 --> 00:02:07.140
Ra's effect, God Phoenix.

00:02:07.140 --> 00:02:11.880
By paying 1000 life points, Marik can incinerate any monster on the field.

00:02:11.880 --> 00:02:15.310
No matter how high their attack points.

00:02:15.770 --> 00:02:19.020
He'll even destroy Yugi's Slifer?

00:02:19.020 --> 00:02:21.340
I don't know.

00:02:21.340 --> 00:02:24.760
Who knows how strong the Gods are.

00:02:24.770 --> 00:02:30.310
But I'm worried that Ra's attack will burn his willpower.

00:02:30.310 --> 00:02:31.570
Yugi...

00:02:31.970 --> 00:02:34.920
Yugi...  Stay strong!

00:02:35.220 --> 00:02:36.030
Marik!

00:02:36.450 --> 00:02:40.540
Ra hasn't taken all of Slifer's attacks!

00:02:42.320 --> 00:02:43.600
Here I go!

00:02:43.600 --> 00:02:46.120
I activate Slifer's effect!

00:02:46.120 --> 00:02:47.540
Lightning Bullet!

00:02:58.020 --> 00:03:01.040
What?  Lightning Bullet didn't work?

00:03:01.040 --> 00:03:06.240
Did you really think lightning arrows could pierce fire armor?

00:03:08.140 --> 00:03:11.360
It's time for my counterattack.

00:03:12.450 --> 00:03:15.570
(chanting)

00:03:15.780 --> 00:03:20.650
The third effect written in hieratic text is coming.

00:03:20.650 --> 00:03:23.680
When time is one, God becomes a phoenix.

00:03:23.680 --> 00:03:26.600
The chosen monster will rest in the earth.

00:03:26.600 --> 00:03:29.520
So even a God will return to nothing?

00:03:29.520 --> 00:03:33.000
I activate God Phoenix's effect.

00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:35.060
I pay 1000 life points.

00:03:36.600 --> 00:03:40.340
But the darkness devours my sacrifice instead of me.

00:03:42.560 --> 00:03:48.720
I'll burn you and your Slifer this turn, Yugi!

00:03:48.960 --> 00:03:52.430
God Phoenix, incinerate his God!

00:04:09.530 --> 00:04:10.730
Yugi!

00:04:12.170 --> 00:04:14.000
Slifer is destroyed!

00:04:17.110 --> 00:04:18.200
Yugi!

00:04:18.200 --> 00:04:20.100
Yugi!  Hang in there!

00:04:24.350 --> 00:04:29.440
Nice.  But I need you to suffer more.

00:04:29.440 --> 00:04:33.730
To make this Shadow Game more exciting.

00:04:35.340 --> 00:04:38.140
Partner!  Stay strong!

00:04:39.080 --> 00:04:40.920
I'm okay.

00:04:41.800 --> 00:04:45.530
But our God Card was destroyed.

00:04:46.350 --> 00:04:48.970
We only have one God Card left.

00:04:51.480 --> 00:04:54.730
Ra, this turn is over.

00:04:54.730 --> 00:04:56.680
Return to the graveyard!

00:04:58.620 --> 00:05:02.820
Good!  Spell cards only last for one turn on a God Card.

00:05:02.820 --> 00:05:05.460
Yugi survived Ra's attack!

00:05:05.460 --> 00:05:08.080
Phew.  That was close.

00:05:08.080 --> 00:05:09.400
Yugi!

00:05:13.460 --> 00:05:19.520
Due to the activation of the trap card, Dark Spell Regeneration...

00:05:19.520 --> 00:05:25.560
...Monster Reborn is placed in your graveyard at the end of your turn.

00:05:25.820 --> 00:05:27.950
But now...

00:05:28.820 --> 00:05:33.000
I activate my set trap, Zombie's Jewel!

00:05:34.050 --> 00:05:36.310
I knew Marik would try something!

00:05:36.310 --> 00:05:41.680
Zombie's Jewel activates when a spell card is placed in your graveyard.

00:05:41.680 --> 00:05:45.170
That spell card is added to my hand.

00:05:45.680 --> 00:05:50.160
So Monster Reborn returns to my hand.

00:05:50.160 --> 00:05:51.460
What?

00:05:51.460 --> 00:05:56.170
You know what that means?

00:05:56.170 --> 00:05:57.630
Huh?  Yugi?

00:06:00.140 --> 00:06:01.760
That's right.

00:06:01.760 --> 00:06:06.360
I'll Special Summon Ra again next turn.

00:06:11.060 --> 00:06:15.820
Yugi, my One Turn Kill will kill you.

00:06:16.100 --> 00:06:22.180
But Zombie's Jewel allows you to draw a card.

00:06:22.180 --> 00:06:25.480
Will that card save you?

00:06:25.480 --> 00:06:28.770
Or is your fate to be buried in eternal darkness?

00:06:30.300 --> 00:06:32.060
My other self...

00:06:32.320 --> 00:06:36.210
The card in this deck will determine our destiny.

00:06:36.210 --> 00:06:40.570
Draw your card, Yugi!

00:06:43.710 --> 00:06:44.810
Brother...

00:06:47.060 --> 00:06:51.750
Yugi, the only way to stop One Turn Kill is to draw that card.

00:06:51.750 --> 00:06:55.530
Yugi has no monsters on his field to defend with.

00:06:55.530 --> 00:06:59.640
If Ra attacks him next turn, it's over!

00:06:59.640 --> 00:07:00.570
But...

00:07:01.100 --> 00:07:07.920
Ra's God Phoenix can only attack monsters on the field.

00:07:08.200 --> 00:07:12.380
Yeah.  But Ra probably has other secret effects.

00:07:12.380 --> 00:07:14.140
Secret effects...

00:07:14.140 --> 00:07:17.520
Is there any way to beat them?

00:07:17.520 --> 00:07:19.080
Don't lose, Yugi!

00:07:19.080 --> 00:07:23.560
Yugi, I'll show you something that'll interest you.

00:07:24.580 --> 00:07:30.030
I know one of your friends is missing.

00:07:30.030 --> 00:07:33.200
Look.  He used to own this.

00:07:33.200 --> 00:07:35.630
The Millennium Ring!  Bakura!

00:07:35.630 --> 00:07:39.660
Marik is behind Bakura's disappearance?

00:07:39.660 --> 00:07:42.070
What did you do with Bakura, Marik?

00:07:42.070 --> 00:07:45.720
This Millennium Ring is my spoils of war.

00:07:45.720 --> 00:07:51.300
The darkness should've devoured him by now until there's nothing left.

00:07:52.530 --> 00:07:57.690
I wish I could show you his final moments!

00:07:58.060 --> 00:08:00.320
God Blaze Cannon!

00:08:10.220 --> 00:08:13.450
Yugi, I'll show you next turn...

00:08:13.450 --> 00:08:17.740
...Ra's absolute destructive power that buried Bakura in darkness!

00:08:20.800 --> 00:08:28.000
Marik!  You hurt my friends Mai, Bakura and Jonouchi!

00:08:28.000 --> 00:08:30.350
I'll never forgive you!

00:08:31.570 --> 00:08:33.850
There's nothing you can do...

00:08:33.850 --> 00:08:37.330
...except pointlessly draw cards and despair.

00:08:37.330 --> 00:08:40.270
Now draw, Yugi!

00:08:41.280 --> 00:08:43.000
The deck is my destiny.

00:08:43.000 --> 00:08:46.940
The top card is a future that can be seen but remains unseen.

00:08:47.600 --> 00:08:51.910
The card that still gives me a small chance is...

00:08:52.360 --> 00:08:54.680
Take this, Yugi!

00:08:57.280 --> 00:08:59.980
The card he gave me.

00:09:00.130 --> 00:09:01.420
I...

00:09:04.950 --> 00:09:07.120
I'll bet it all on this card!

00:09:08.260 --> 00:09:12.430
Yugi's deck is where souls meet.

00:09:18.560 --> 00:09:22.170
I set a card and end my turn.

00:09:23.120 --> 00:09:24.400
What?

00:09:24.400 --> 00:09:26.640
He didn't look at the card he drew!

00:09:26.640 --> 00:09:31.380
He set it without knowing what card he has.

00:09:31.380 --> 00:09:33.150
Why'd he do that?

00:09:33.150 --> 00:09:35.950
Brother, what card did Yugi draw?

00:09:36.180 --> 00:09:42.200
No way!  He knows what card he drew without looking at it?

00:09:44.970 --> 00:09:45.990
Can it be?

00:09:47.670 --> 00:09:50.830
Is Yugi going to create a miracle?

00:10:13.310 --> 00:10:17.660
I set a card and end my turn.

00:10:19.200 --> 00:10:25.030
No way!  He knows what card he drew without looking at it?

00:10:25.740 --> 00:10:28.820
Is Yugi going to create a miracle?

00:10:29.730 --> 00:10:31.260
Yugi Muto!

00:10:31.260 --> 00:10:35.180
You're not allowed to set a card without looking at it.

00:10:35.180 --> 00:10:38.260
If that card is a monster, the rules state-

00:10:38.260 --> 00:10:38.920
Isono!

00:10:38.920 --> 00:10:39.620
Y-Yes sir!

00:10:39.860 --> 00:10:41.400
How interesting.

00:10:43.740 --> 00:10:45.750
Let him continue.

00:10:45.750 --> 00:10:46.490
Yes, sir!

00:10:49.680 --> 00:10:54.600
Has the fear of death and defeat driven you mad, Yugi?

00:10:54.600 --> 00:10:58.320
That's the last card you'll ever draw in your life.

00:10:58.320 --> 00:11:02.040
Shouldn't you take a good look?

00:11:02.040 --> 00:11:04.210
Marik!  It's your turn!

00:11:05.170 --> 00:11:07.060
My turn!  I draw!

00:11:10.310 --> 00:11:12.980
I won't let you lose by disqualification.

00:11:12.980 --> 00:11:17.420
I'll send you to hell in ultimate pain!

00:11:17.640 --> 00:11:18.650
Here I go!

00:11:20.750 --> 00:11:22.760
I activate Monster Reborn!

00:11:30.570 --> 00:11:31.870
Here it comes!

00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:36.310
Sun god, resurrect!

00:11:36.310 --> 00:11:38.360
The Winged Dragon of Ra!

00:11:41.200 --> 00:11:54.620
(chanting)

00:11:54.620 --> 00:11:59.990
The ancient incantation gives me power!

00:11:59.990 --> 00:12:00.930
What?

00:12:03.040 --> 00:12:08.200
I'll show you Ra's secret effect.

00:12:08.200 --> 00:12:12.720
Open your eyes and burn it into your memories!

00:12:20.360 --> 00:12:22.620
Marik is vanishing!

00:12:22.620 --> 00:12:25.300
What's going on?

00:12:25.300 --> 00:12:26.290
Yugi...

00:12:29.500 --> 00:12:35.700
Ra's secret effect allows me to fuse with my God!

00:12:43.600 --> 00:12:46.110
Marik and Ra united into one!

00:12:48.100 --> 00:12:52.110
Witness Ra's secret effect!

00:12:52.110 --> 00:12:59.550
I'm left with 1 life point, and the rest is transferred to Ra's attack points.

00:12:59.760 --> 00:13:00.700
What?

00:13:00.700 --> 00:13:02.390
That's not all!

00:13:02.640 --> 00:13:09.570
By tributing the monster on my field, it absorbs its attack points!

00:13:13.260 --> 00:13:15.660
Ra's attack points increase!

00:13:16.700 --> 00:13:21.400
4699 attack points!

00:13:21.880 --> 00:13:24.880
This is One Turn Kill!

00:13:24.880 --> 00:13:27.880
Yugi, you're finished!

00:13:28.820 --> 00:13:31.380
Yugi has 3300 life points!

00:13:31.380 --> 00:13:35.880
If Ra attacks him directly, Yugi will have 0 life points!

00:13:35.880 --> 00:13:37.010
Oh no!

00:13:37.010 --> 00:13:39.370
Can't Yugi do anything?

00:13:39.600 --> 00:13:42.330
Brother, Yugi's going to lose?

00:13:42.330 --> 00:13:45.740
Yugi, if you drew that card...

00:13:45.740 --> 00:13:49.200
...if you can create a miracle, show me!

00:13:50.820 --> 00:13:53.140
Prepare yourself, Yugi!

00:13:53.140 --> 00:13:56.220
I'll incinerate every last drop of your blood!

00:13:56.220 --> 00:13:57.910
Ra attacks!

00:13:58.160 --> 00:14:00.030
I flip over my set card!

00:14:00.030 --> 00:14:00.980
What?

00:14:00.980 --> 00:14:02.970
Fiend's Sanctuary!

00:14:06.040 --> 00:14:08.460
Fiend's Sanctuary?

00:14:08.860 --> 00:14:12.480
Yugi knew he had that card without looking?

00:14:13.550 --> 00:14:19.930
When I touched that card, I felt the pulse of your soul, Kaiba.

00:14:20.200 --> 00:14:25.300
He drew that card when he was in trouble?

00:14:25.300 --> 00:14:29.220
Is that the power of friendship?  A miracle?

00:14:30.580 --> 00:14:33.970
I activate my Quick-Play Spell!

00:14:36.450 --> 00:14:37.730
What?

00:14:37.730 --> 00:14:40.250
There's a magical circle on Yugi's field!

00:14:43.200 --> 00:14:45.630
Something's coming out!

00:14:54.400 --> 00:14:56.600
Metal Fiend Token!

00:14:56.600 --> 00:15:03.780
Fiend's Sanctuary's effect brings a Metal Fiend Token.

00:15:04.040 --> 00:15:05.800
And its effect is...

00:15:06.800 --> 00:15:10.220
I'm reflected on to Metal Fiend!

00:15:10.220 --> 00:15:14.480
That's right.  Metal Fiend is your copy.

00:15:14.480 --> 00:15:16.220
When it's destroyed in battle...

00:15:16.220 --> 00:15:21.520
...you lose life points equal to Metal Fiend Token's attack points.

00:15:21.520 --> 00:15:28.900
So when Metal Fiend blocks your attack, it means you're defending me, Marik!

00:15:29.840 --> 00:15:34.930
Its attack points are equal to your life points.

00:15:34.930 --> 00:15:39.080
So Metal Fiend has 1 attack point!

00:15:40.700 --> 00:15:42.450
1 point...

00:15:43.200 --> 00:15:49.390
When Ra attacks Metal Fiend, you'll lose your life point and lose!

00:15:50.560 --> 00:15:51.720
Wow!

00:15:51.720 --> 00:15:54.470
It's the key card to defeat Ra!

00:15:54.470 --> 00:15:56.040
You did it, Yugi!

00:15:56.040 --> 00:15:57.860
Yugi will win!

00:16:00.970 --> 00:16:05.880
Oh no!  I already declared my attack!

00:16:13.110 --> 00:16:18.040
Marik!  You lose by attacking your own copy!

00:16:32.310 --> 00:16:33.460
I won.

00:16:36.460 --> 00:16:39.540
Metal Fiend is still on the field?

00:17:05.040 --> 00:17:06.640
What's going on?

00:17:06.640 --> 00:17:09.740
Marik has 4700 life points!

00:17:12.340 --> 00:17:18.460
When Ra attacked Metal Fiend, I activated a spell card.

00:17:18.460 --> 00:17:19.680
What?

00:17:22.620 --> 00:17:28.450
I used the De-Fusion you gave me to undo the fusion with my God.

00:17:28.450 --> 00:17:35.250
When Ra and Marik undo their fusion, De-Fusion's effect ends the battle.

00:17:35.250 --> 00:17:38.720
So the attack on Metal Fiend is negated.

00:17:40.130 --> 00:17:44.570
I never expected him to use De-Fusion this way.

00:17:44.570 --> 00:17:49.950
Since he used De-Fusion after Ra gained attack points...

00:17:49.950 --> 00:17:54.170
...Marik regained a lot of life points.

00:17:55.280 --> 00:18:01.350
Fiend's Sanctuary was supposed to turn the tables, but it ended up helping Marik.

00:18:01.560 --> 00:18:02.720
Yugi...

00:18:08.780 --> 00:18:14.100
But Fiend's Sanctuary isn't just for stopping Ra's effects.

00:18:14.320 --> 00:18:17.540
Yugi, can you use it to its full potential?

00:18:20.460 --> 00:18:26.320
Since I regained my life points, my sacrifice has his body back.

00:18:27.360 --> 00:18:29.850
He's quite tough.

00:18:29.850 --> 00:18:31.880
Rishido...

00:18:33.340 --> 00:18:36.320
Ra!  Return to the graveyard!

00:18:39.620 --> 00:18:43.480
I also send Monster Reborn to the graveyard.

00:18:45.040 --> 00:18:47.900
I set a card!

00:18:49.500 --> 00:18:51.000
I end my turn!

00:18:51.000 --> 00:18:57.010
Damn!  If Marik uses Monster Reborn next time, he'll summon Ra again!

00:18:57.010 --> 00:18:58.940
Yugi!  Do something!

00:18:59.240 --> 00:19:00.780
My turn.

00:19:03.680 --> 00:19:08.120
I have to pay 1000 life points every turn to keep Metal Fiend Token.

00:19:11.300 --> 00:19:12.400
Partner...

00:19:12.620 --> 00:19:14.130
I'll be fine.

00:19:14.130 --> 00:19:16.640
Fight the way you like.

00:19:18.640 --> 00:19:19.820
I draw!

00:19:21.860 --> 00:19:24.200
Sorry, partner.  Stay strong!

00:19:27.520 --> 00:19:31.760
I pay 1000 life points to keep Metal Fiend Token!

00:19:36.620 --> 00:19:37.980
Are you stupid?

00:19:38.200 --> 00:19:40.990
It only has 1 attack point!

00:19:40.990 --> 00:19:45.400
Why keep that Token when it can't attack nor defend?

00:19:47.370 --> 00:19:49.530
He figured it out.

00:19:49.940 --> 00:19:57.470
Kaiba, I felt our souls cross when I drew Fiend's Sanctuary.

00:19:57.470 --> 00:20:01.140
My field is ready!

00:20:01.140 --> 00:20:05.610
Fiend's Sanctuary has the power to stop a God and summon a God!

00:20:05.800 --> 00:20:06.920
Here I go!

00:20:06.920 --> 00:20:09.740
I flip over my set card!

00:20:09.740 --> 00:20:10.850
Multiply!

00:20:12.320 --> 00:20:14.590
What?  Multiply?

00:20:14.590 --> 00:20:21.280
This spell splits a monster with 500 or lower attack points.

00:20:23.540 --> 00:20:27.300
What?  He's gathering tributes to summon a God?

00:20:27.300 --> 00:20:32.240
Fiend's Sanctuary is a magical sanctuary that summons a God!

00:20:32.240 --> 00:20:37.180
Yugi is summoning Obelisk, another card he received from Seto!

00:20:37.400 --> 00:20:41.050
I tribute three Metal Fiend Tokens.

00:20:43.500 --> 00:20:46.050
Come, the God of Destruction!

00:20:46.050 --> 00:20:47.150
Obelisk!

00:21:12.200 --> 00:21:13.660
It's here!

00:21:14.040 --> 00:21:16.180
The third God Card!

00:21:16.180 --> 00:21:18.150
Obelisk the Tormentor!

00:21:18.400 --> 00:21:22.460
Marik has no monsters to defend with!

00:21:22.460 --> 00:21:24.460
He's defenseless!

00:21:24.460 --> 00:21:28.030
Obelisk will attack him directly!

00:21:28.980 --> 00:21:31.200
Obelisk the Tormentor!

00:21:32.370 --> 00:21:35.600
Obelisk the Tormentor attacks!

00:21:35.600 --> 00:21:38.110
God Hand Crusher!

00:21:57.420 --> 00:22:01.110
Obelisk's God Hand Crusher struck Marik!

00:22:01.110 --> 00:22:05.140
All right!  Marik has few life points left!

00:22:05.140 --> 00:22:07.710
But why is he laughing confidently?

00:22:07.710 --> 00:22:10.970
And Yugi looks like he's in trouble.

00:22:10.970 --> 00:22:14.760
Is it because Marik is holding his other personality hostage?

00:22:15.050 --> 00:22:18.040
As Yugi hesitates to attack, blocking his way is...

00:22:18.040 --> 00:22:20.240
What?  Obelisk the Tormentor?

00:22:20.240 --> 00:22:24.000
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Immortal Wall  Egyptian God Slime

00:22:24.000 --> 00:22:25.600
Duel, standby!

00:22:32.370 --> 00:22:41.280
The streets flow by, colored in red

00:22:41.780 --> 00:22:49.620
If you notice your pain, it changes to joy

00:22:51.350 --> 00:23:00.780
People learn of friendship every time they wipe their tears

00:23:01.400 --> 00:23:10.300
With the warm strength you gave me, I'll change them into kindness

00:23:10.870 --> 00:23:19.330
My overflowing emotions don't stop

00:23:20.110 --> 00:23:24.840
I'll live feeling them

00:23:25.450 --> 00:23:30.020
For me to be me

00:23:30.020 --> 00:23:38.480
Overflowing friendship heals me

00:23:39.160 --> 00:23:44.120
Our chance meeting was real

00:23:44.640 --> 00:23:53.780
We'll both understand that someday
